OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1985, a small rural town
OL,7,     Fwelcomed a group of Catholic
OL,8,     Fmissionaries, unaware one would
OL,9,     Fone day be Pope. Among the altar
OL,10,     Fboys was a teenager who would go
OL,11,     Fon to be his friend.
